{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bungle Blast you are lost in the jungle and crazy creatures surround you. You must dodge the creatures and rid the jungle of them. How will you do this? With your weapons of course! Choose from a variety of unique weapons to find one that fits your play style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133310/extras/d5ef398b0af7df7bb4cee8a8b1d901c0.avif?t=1762654205\" width=1166 height=514 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you clear a section of the jungle, you will move on to a new region with more challenging creatures. But don't worry - you'll be rewarded with an upgrade that can help you in the next section. Once your almost out of the jungle you'll be faced with a powerful boss enemy.\u00a0 Defeat the boss and you'll have a chance to purchase new and different upgrades before you move on to the next zone.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133310/extras/047479cf92b9d3c56ab06018c79084aa.avif?t=1762654205\" width=748 height=330 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you will explore new places and meet new creatures. . .\u00a0 that keep attacking you for some reason. Murt is lurking the volcano, Jugo hides in the jungle bushes, and watch out for Zock's electrifying speed! It will be a difficult journey to make but you must take down all your opponents in Bungle Blast a rogue-like action packed game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133310/extras/dd0e9bade88da4bff840d7a809999331.avif?t=1762654205\" width=1166 height=514 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepageba